@startuml rmi_login
title RMI — Login & Message Flow

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA

actor Client

participant "Client\n(base class)" as CB
participant "ClientRmi\n(doLogin)" as CR
participant "ServerRmi" as SR
participant "ClientHandlerRmi" as CHR
participant "MatchManager" as MM

note over CB, CR
  Client.login() is defined in the abstract base class.
  ClientRmi.doLogin() is the transport-specific implementation
  called after validation passes.
end note

== Login — Success ==

Client -> CB : login(nickname)
CB -> CB : check: nickname null/blank?\n→ no: proceed
CB -> CR : doLogin(nickname)
CR -> SR : login(nickname, clientStub)  [remote call]
SR -> CHR : new ClientHandlerRmi(nickname, clientStub, this)
SR -> MM : login(nickname, rmiHandler)
MM --> SR : [no exception]
SR -> CHR : rmiHandler.startHealthCheck()
SR --> CR : [return]
CR -> CR : vm.setNickname(nickname)\nui.onLogin(nickname)\nstartHealthCheck()  [client-side health check]
CR --> CB : true
CB --> Client : true

== Login — Alt: Empty/Null Nickname ==

Client -> CB : login(nickname)
CB -> CB : check: nickname null/blank?\n→ yes: ui.printError(new InvalidUsernameException("Il nickname non può essere vuoto."))\nreturn false (without remote call)
CB --> Client : false

== Login — Alt: InvalidUsernameException ==

Client -> CB : login(nickname)
CB -> CB : check: nickname null/blank?\n→ no: proceed
CB -> CR : doLogin(nickname)
CR -> SR : login(nickname, clientStub)  [remote call]
SR -> CHR : new ClientHandlerRmi(nickname, clientStub, this)
SR -> MM : login(nickname, rmiHandler)
note right of MM
  nickname already registered → InvalidUsernameException("Username già esistente nella lobby, inserire un nuovo username")
  (the null/blank check was already performed in Client.login(),
  but MatchManager re-executes it as a server-side defense)
end note
MM --> SR : throws InvalidUsernameException("Username già esistente nella lobby, inserire un nuovo username")

SR --> CR : InvalidUsernameException (rethrown)
CR -> CR : ui.printError(e)\nreturn false
CR --> CB : false
CB --> Client : false

@enduml